   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "### Notes from the developer (MostAadTech)\nUltraTex Modular FAST v0.2.3 \u2014 view resolution and 6/12-view count are controlled ONLY on Generate. Prepare owns UVs and reference mask. IMPORTANT: for BiRefNet, mask_polarity=foreground. Bake SETUP comes from Generate 4th output. For 12-view Albedo, the MR Generate node may use 6 views. Use UV mode comfy_gpu when you need the same unwrap behavior as v3.1; keep_existing to save time if UVs are already valid. 4 steps used as requested. No GPU benchmark was run on this package."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "UltraTex Modular FAST v0.2.3 \u2014 view resolution and 6/12-view count are controlled ONLY on Generate. Prepare owns UVs and reference mask. IMPORTANT: for BiRefNet, mask_polarity=foreground. Bake SETUP comes from Generate 4th output. For 12-view Albedo, the MR Generate node may use 6 views. Use UV mode comfy_gpu when you need the same unwrap behavior as v3.1; keep_existing to save time if UVs are already valid. 4 steps used as requested. No GPU benchmark was run on this package."
   },
   "color": "#323",
   "bgcolor": "#545",
   "title": "Developer notes \u00b7 MostAadTech"
